              <td className="py-3 px-4 font-mono text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 bg-blue-50/30 dark:bg-blue-950/10 font-semibold tabular-nums">
                ${activeIntel.zollAnnualServicePerUnit}/unit/yr (Fixed 5-Yr Price Cap)
